{"id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","display":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","aliases":["73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","73-df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine"],"display":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</span><span>73-df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (oracle language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\)</span>, configuration set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OConf}_O\">\\(\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\)</span>, input <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}\">\\(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}\\)</span>, and step <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_O^B\">\\(\\to_O^B\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\">\\(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\)</span> 等均为固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的分量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>，不是额外自由选择的状态。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 及部分值记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 为候选运行函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\\)</span> 的参数为候选有效神谕程序；运行和代价子句使用其已声明的有效机器实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\rho(0)=C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_O^B\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\;\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\rho(0)=C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_O^B\\rho(i+1)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\;\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(w,m)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\left(\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,r,\\rho)\\},m\\right)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\right\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B:\\mathbf2^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(w,m)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\left(\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,r,\\rho)\\},m\\right)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\right\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B:\\mathbf2^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{otime}_O^B)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{otime}_O^B\\land r\\le c|w|^k))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{otime}_O^B)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{otime}_O^B\\land r\\le c|w|^k))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each oracle query and response is one transition in this model; query-string construction is charged through ordinary transitions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resol